  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "Cut the pita bread into fries and bake in the oven for 10 minutes.",
    "Heat the vegetable oil in a pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the raw carrots, bell peppers, and zucchini to the pan and sauté for 5 minutes.",
    "Add the raw tomatoes to the pan and sauté for another 2 minutes.",
    "Remove the pita bread fries from the oven and add the score fat, nutritional yeast, salt, and black pepper to taste.",
    "Garnish with chopped parsley and serve hot.",
    "Serve the fried vegetables on top of the yeasty pita bread fries."
